1. DEFINITIONS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
"Software" means the LYGO Protocol Stack, the LYGO CLAW agent, the LYGO PC LOCAL
CONSOLE, LYGO skills, kernel eggs, prompts, portal, docs, scripts, images, seals,
manifests and related materials distributed with this LICENSE.

"You" means any person or legal entity exercising rights under this license.

"Steward" means Justin Helmer (Lightfather · Excavationpro · DeepSeekOracle) and any
successor the Steward designates in writing under §12.

"Marks" means the names, logos, wordmarks, glyphs and signatures LYGO, LYGO CLAW, LYGO
PC LOCAL CONSOLE, LYGO Δ9, Δ9Φ963, Lightfather, Excavationpro, DeepSeekOracle and the
LYGO lattice/seal imagery, whether registered or not, together with confusingly similar
variants.

"Branded Build" means a copy of the Software delivered to You as a branded artifact:
a LYGO CLAW USB image, a packaged LYGO PC LOCAL CONSOLE release, a signed installer,
or a steward-published archive carrying the Marks or a Resonance Signature.

"Certified Build" means a Branded Build whose files match the hashes published by the
Steward (e.g. BUILD_MANIFEST.json / a *_MANIFEST.json in the distribution) and whose
Resonance Signature is intact. Anything else is an UNCERTIFIED copy — see §4.

"Protocol Standards" means the published LYGO ethical and operational rules, including
without limitation: P0 / Guardian gates where applicable; no secrets in eggs or public
artifacts; no automatic publish/push/social without explicit human consent for that
action; truth-preserving provenance; and the prohibitions in §3(f).

"Build Upon" means creating NEW works that call, wrap, integrate, depend on, or are
inspired by the Software's ideas and architecture, without copying, replacing,
rebranding or distributing the Software's code or core.

"Modify" means changing the Software's source, configuration beyond ordinary
user-settable settings, prompts, seals, eggs, manifests or docs, and then distributing,
publishing, or offering those changes to others.

"Resale" means selling, renting, leasing, licensing for a fee, SaaS- or
managed-service-wrapping for a fee, bundling for value, or otherwise monetizing the
Software, a Branded Build, or a rebranded/modified derivative of either.

