  (c) DISTRIBUTE MODIFIED versions of the Software's core (source, skills, kernel
      seeder, eggs, anchors, portal, prompts or protocol docs) publicly or to third
      parties, except:
        • private local changes that never leave Your control, OR
        • contributions submitted back to the Steward under this license, OR
        • written permission from the Steward;

  (d) STRIP, HIDE, ALTER or FORGE copyright notices, this LICENSE, the NOTICE,
      TRADEMARKS.md, Resonance Signatures, seals, hashes, manifests, Merkle roots, or
      attribution of authorship;

  (e) REBRAND: rename, re-logo, re-theme, re-sign, or otherwise re-identify the
      Software or a Branded Build so that it appears to be Your product, a different
      product, an unaffiliated product, or an official LYGO release when it is not;

  (f) USE the Software for mass suppression, non-consensual behaviour manipulation at
      scale, surveillance-state tooling, social-credit style control, weapons, or
      other prohibited uses listed in Protocol Standards;

  (g) FORK into a hostile or corrupt variant intended to defeat P0 / Guardian gates,
      inject deception, or launder the Marks onto a modified build;

  (h) CLAIM ownership of the Software, claim to be the Steward, the LYGO protocol, or
