    (small live window + complete record, gates, sovereignty, lattice continuity) —
    ideas and architecture are not monopolised by this license; the CODE and the
    BRAND are;
  • Plant your own eggs via the seeder while keeping sovereign seals honest;
  • Document integration with eternalhaven / lattice anchors truthfully;
  • Attribute: "Built on LYGO Δ9 Protocol — steward: Justin Helmer / Lightfather".

Building ON TOP ≠ taking the core, renaming it, and selling it.
An independent reimplementation that copies no LYGO code and carries none of the Marks
is outside this license — and is welcome, with attribution of the inspiration.

